# Yankee Doodle — traditional (public domain).
# Arranged by the Piano Practice contributors (MIT): the hands take turns in middle-C
# position. Right hand C D E F (fingers 1 2 3 4), left hand G A B (fingers 4 3 2).
title: Yankee Doodle
composer: Traditional
arranger: Piano Practice contributors
time: 4/4
key: 0
tempo: 104
license: Public domain (traditional), arrangement MIT
---
RH: c4/4 c4 d4 e4 | c4 e4 d4 r | c4 c4 d4 e4 | c4/2 r/2 |
LH: r/1           | r/2. g3/4  | r/1         | r/2 b3/2 |

RH: c4/4 c4 d4 e4 | f4 e4 d4 c4 | r/1           | c4/2 c4/2 |
LH: r/1           | r/1         | b3/4 g3 a3 b3 | r/1       |
